1c:["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"：YkkCloud 官网只放三档月付——每月 150G 十四元、300G 二十六元、500G 四十元。"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"本文这次注册进了它的后台"}]}],["$","$1","3",{"children":"，把官网看不到的东西核了出来，最该先知道的是三条。"}],["$","$1","4",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"第一，季付是纯亏"}]}],["$","$1","5",{"children":"：三档季付分别 42／78／120 元，正好等于月付乘三，"}],["$","$1","6",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"一分钱不省"}]}],["$","$1","7",{"children":"；半年付才 92～94 折，年付 86～88 折（一年省 24／38／57 元）。要压周期就跳过季付、直接看年付。"}],["$","$1","8",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"第二，官网 FAQ 卖的「终身套餐」不存在"}]}],["$","$1","9",{"children":"：后台四档套餐的一次性价格字段全是空的，下单页只有月／季／半年／年四个选项。"}],["$","$1","10",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"第三，「Netflix 劫持节点, 免登录观看奈飞」这个卖点，它自家文档那一页的英文标题就叫 Man-in-the-middle Attack Service"}]}],["$","$1","11",{"children":"——用法是去 "}],["$","$1","12",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"mitm.it"}]}],["$","$1","13",{"children":" 装一张根证书（安卓还要装 Magisk 模块），装完这台设备走它节点时的 HTTPS 对代理方不再是密文。顺带纠正本站上一版的两处：它"}],["$","$1","14",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"有退款条款"}]}],["$","$1","15",{"children":"（购后三日内、用量小于 5GiB、未用优惠码，扣 10% 手续费），本站上一版按官网首页搜不到「退款」二字就写成没有，是错的；它也"}],["$","$1","16",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"不是无人维护"}]}],["$","$1","17",{"children":"——Telegram 频道确实停在 2026 年 2 月 16 日，但后台套餐 2026 年 6 月 12 日刚统一改过、公告 7 月 14 日才更新过。"}],["$","$1","18",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"买法"}]}],["$","$1","19",{"children":"：月付试水，别装那张证书，要压周期就压年付、绝不碰季付。速度、节点与流媒体解锁本文一律未实测。"}]]}],"\n"]}]
